 Components (all GPL-3.0-or-later)
 ---------------------------------
   look-and-feel/windows-7-enhanced         Plasma global theme
   look-and-feel/windows-7-enhanced-splash  splash (fork of windows7splash)
   plasma/desktoptheme/windows-7-enhanced   Plasma theme (fork of ExposeAir)
   aurorae/themes/windows-7-enhanced        window decoration (fork of ExposeAir)
   kvantum/windows-7-enhanced               Kvantum theme (fork of ExposeAir)
   color-schemes/Windows7Enhanced           color scheme
   color-schemes/Windows7EnhancedAero       color scheme (fork of ExposeAir)

 Not in this repository
